    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/77bf771da48317173aa46e28dfd59fb5.avif?t=1755076006\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Feelings is a mental wellness experience that promotes empathy, connection, and positivity among players. So grab a blanket, your favourite hoody, and a nice beverage and come chat around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo your childhood dreams still echo in who you\u2019ve become?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo you prefer to cook food, or have someone cook food for you?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts on a range of topics - sometimes sweet, sometimes profound - to help create a rich and meaningful tapestry of thoughts and feelings that are personal and authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock objects to furnish your campfire, and make it your place to stop and take a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share experiences, express your emotions, and be a part of a caring community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations are with real people, but are not live, and there is no direct interaction with others. Discover their thoughts at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answers are moderated and filtered to ensure your safety. Content warnings can be set according to your preferences so certain topics are avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/77bf771da48317173aa46e28dfd59fb5.avif?t=1755076006\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/5278d9d043cecc777383ed9ba76c551a.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Feelings is a mental wellness experience that promotes empathy, connection, and positivity among players. So grab a blanket, your favourite hoody, and a nice beverage and come chat around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/ae74250f327819805506cecd02124461.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo your childhood dreams still echo in who you\u2019ve become?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo you prefer to cook food, or have someone cook food for you?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts on a range of topics - sometimes sweet, sometimes profound - to help create a rich and meaningful tapestry of thoughts and feelings that are personal and authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/15496feffca2530d76a009ae7df567a9.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock objects to furnish your campfire, and make it your place to stop and take a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/f78061fae5284b0246f41724403f247c.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share experiences, express your emotions, and be a part of a caring community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations are with real people, but are not live, and there is no direct interaction with others. Discover their thoughts at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answers are moderated and filtered to ensure your safety. Content warnings can be set according to your preferences so certain topics are avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.poster.avif?t=1755076006\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.webm?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/26e8555fb7a90a9e3ce0f131f6939dba.mp4?t=1755076006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
